WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.000
Coming from tmux, zellij or herdr?

00:02.000 --> 00:04.600
tuios finds your tmux.conf and offers its keys.

00:04.600 --> 00:11.750
The tmux preset: ctrl+b, then " or % to split. The mode pill shows the prefix.

00:11.750 --> 00:20.200
zellij and screen keys too. Change them any time.

00:20.200 --> 00:25.650
Tools that call tmux get tuios panes through tuios tmux-shim.

00:25.650 --> 00:30.000
What is missing? github.com/Gaurav-Gosain/tuios/discussions/850
